  "details": "Many Avatars with large hands or fingers - most Furry avatars for example - make it really hard to use the hand tracking pinch menus, because the menu tooltips are inside the avatars hands or fingers. It would be very helpful to have an option that allows users to see this menu through their hands, so we know what which gesture does or how much more we have to pinch to select something.",
